                            "superlative"
                        ],
                        "form": "most deluxe"
                    },
                    {
                        "form_id": "73579309-80d1-484c-ae19-593c7df49455",
                        "entry_id": "b3382c26-066a-30e8-87d5-847af56bb89a",
                        "tags": [
                            "superlative"
                        ],
                        "form": "deluxest"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "0bfaebf3-9093-3a89-a524-556c3671fa83",
                        "entry_id": "b3382c26-066a-30e8-87d5-847af56bb89a",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Very fine in quality or luxurious."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "28308472-f591-4376-b8ad-72e7dfd03ad4",
                                "sense_id": "0bfaebf3-9093-3a89-a524-556c3671fa83",
                                "text": "The band released a deluxe version of their LP, containing bonus tracks and with a personal message by all the members in the sleeve."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "4f06806e-1305-4d3a-b982-dad22f82401a",
                                "sense_id": "0bfaebf3-9093-3a89-a524-556c3671fa83",
                                "text": "“I have here, sir,” he said, “one of the deluxest editions de luxe now in print. Observe the handsome tree calf binding, notice the gold gilt crinkle edges and stand aghast with admiration before the profuse and artistic illustrations.”"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "960ead0b-31f9-49a0-9833-004edcd73632",
                                "sense_id": "0bfaebf3-9093-3a89-a524-556c3671fa83",
                                "text": "The Reforma is Mexico’s deluxest hotel—and it is about as Mexican as the Ziegfeld Follies."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "1f8122bf-e5c3-498b-ba29-6164b0036b45",
                                "sense_id": "0bfaebf3-9093-3a89-a524-556c3671fa83",
                                "text": "And fer the deluxest of ’em all, get our reg. $59.95 list 20-inch Reversible Window Fan, $39.99, sucks in cool air or blows out hot air."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "39626097-7835-4c69-8e93-19a7e2241cf8",
                                "sense_id": "0bfaebf3-9093-3a89-a524-556c3671fa83",
                                "text": "And many a noble heart takes shelter under roofs no grander nor deluxer than this one."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "cefdbfcf-6f57-4ebc-9db4-5d3f1b3421fc",
                                "sense_id": "0bfaebf3-9093-3a89-a524-556c3671fa83",
                                "text": "It is probably the most deluxest hospice in New York and was until recently the pied-a-tree of Clare Booth Luce and her consort, Chinaboy Henry, otherwise known as Fui Piu."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "9b08487c-e3c1-4a8c-a3ea-b2a44b380b07",
                                "sense_id": "0bfaebf3-9093-3a89-a524-556c3671fa83",
                                "text": "A tribe of North Carolina Indians routs the Ku Klux Klan. Carolina war party chant: “Nothing is deluxer than to chase a Ku Ku Kluxer in the morning.”"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "fbc3d7a7-5a58-4e09-832b-c210f185a67c",
                                "sense_id": "0bfaebf3-9093-3a89-a524-556c3671fa83",
                                "text": "There’s nothing deluxer than the kitchen equipment in this house."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "b0ed2bce-7f2c-45f6-bd0b-343e9dbd1ab4",
                                "sense_id": "0bfaebf3-9093-3a89-a524-556c3671fa83",
                                "text": "The trend started with custom builders and their efforts in the game of one-upmanship for that “deluxer than thou” touch."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "54a2b0b6-c651-4131-8114-321a7a9721b5",
                                "sense_id": "0bfaebf3-9093-3a89-a524-556c3671fa83",
                                "text": "Winging your way all Nudie’d up is the Deluxest Burrito of them all — swell if you don’t break a tooth on the sequins."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "c082cd8d-b8a9-49c0-8ac5-d6123f483351",
                                "sense_id": "0bfaebf3-9093-3a89-a524-556c3671fa83",
                                "text": "Deluxest Of Christmas Dinners / For a posh Christmas celebration, some families take in the famous Bracebridge Dinner pageant, which has been held at The Ahwahnee for four decades, still with the original cast and its descendants."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "017c0f3c-73a5-4b82-bf80-c882e1b314e3",
                                "sense_id": "0bfaebf3-9093-3a89-a524-556c3671fa83",
                                "text": "“Guess you foiled me this time, good buddy. But now”—and here he turns from the mountains, his eyes dancing with that new energy, his lips in a sly smile—“now it’s time for my deluxest yarn. The greatest story ever told.”"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "f90e608a-75b1-4fdb-847a-ce7999513bc5",
                                "sense_id": "0bfaebf3-9093-3a89-a524-556c3671fa83",
                                "text": "The Madame du Pompadour was everything the fag clerk said it was: the deluxest deluxe either one of them had ever stood inside."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "4daacf00-07b7-4efd-aed3-7e51a05fc341",
                                "sense_id": "0bfaebf3-9093-3a89-a524-556c3671fa83",
                                "text": "Deluxer than Ever / Deluxe Paint is getting another facelift from Electronic Arts (1820 Gateway Drive, San Mateo, California 94404, 415-571-7171)."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "141eeed9-e164-4d5a-9d2c-b910a41c333b",
                                "sense_id": "0bfaebf3-9093-3a89-a524-556c3671fa83",
                                "text": "“You haven’t heard of Mrs. Kirkland’s?” She can scarcely believe my ignorance. “It’s the deluxest establishment in the city. Mrs. Kirkland says everybody dreams of making love to a movie star. I thought everybody had heard of Mrs. Kirkland’s.” “Sit down.” “Very deluxe,” she repeats, still standing. “We have a splendid piano player, you should come just to hear him.[…]”"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "f694fc34-1c6b-463f-8101-2e3dd722db81",
                                "sense_id": "0bfaebf3-9093-3a89-a524-556c3671fa83",
                                "text": "The Luxor’s “Blue Man Group” is de-luxer than its long-running editions in New York, Boston and Chicago."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "15f41cab-9634-4718-879a-00d4ed093726",
                                "sense_id": "0bfaebf3-9093-3a89-a524-556c3671fa83",
                                "text": "“Safety reasons,” she snorts, dousing herself recklessly with borrowed floods of her mother’s deluxest perfume, thinking again of Mr. Loser’s obnoxious phone call."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "9ee55f9d-8f3c-41b2-accf-e9fd7382b42f",
                                "sense_id": "0bfaebf3-9093-3a89-a524-556c3671fa83",
                                "text": "This condo was nicer than Richard’s fancy high-rise condo in Chicago and deluxer than their Deluxe Park View Suite at the Ritz."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
